    "出題レンジと問題数を選び、難易度を選ぶとクイズが始まります。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Pick a range and the number of questions, then choose a difficulty to start the quiz."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出題レンジと問題数を選び、難易度を選ぶとクイズが始まります。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "出題レンジで「おまかせ」以外を選ぶと、上記のレンジを上書きします。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Choosing anything other than Auto for the range overrides the ranges above."
          }
        },
        "ja": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "出題レンジで「おまかせ」以外を選ぶと、上記のレンジを上書きします。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "選んだ問題数に答えると、正解数がスコアとして表示されます。": {
      "localizations": {
        "en": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Once you answer the chosen number of questions, your number of correct answers is shown as your score."
